Phase 1 -- Brainstorming & Ideation

Project Title

FitBuddy -- AI-Powered Personalized Fitness and Wellness Planner

1. Problem Statement

Many people need simple and personalized guidance to plan regular
physical activity and maintain healthy daily habits. Generic workout
plans may not consider a user's goal, preferred intensity, or feedback.

FitBuddy is proposed as an AI-powered wellness application that
generates a personalized seven-day workout plan and provides general
nutrition/recovery guidance. Users can also submit feedback and receive
an updated plan.

2. Idea Generation

The project idea was developed around the following needs: -
Personalized workout planning - Simple and easy-to-use fitness
guidance - AI-assisted plan generation - General nutrition and recovery
tips - Ability to improve a plan based on user feedback - A web-based
interface that is easy to access - Storage of user plans for later
viewing

3. Proposed Solution

FitBuddy will be developed as a web application using: - Frontend:
HTML, CSS and JavaScript with Jinja2 templates - Backend: Python
FastAPI - Database: SQLite with SQLAlchemy - AI: Google Gemini
API - API Documentation: FastAPI Swagger UI and ReDoc

The application will collect basic user information such as user ID,
name, age, weight, goal and preferred intensity. It will then generate a
seven-day general wellness workout plan and a nutrition/recovery tip.

Users can provide feedback about the generated plan. FitBuddy will use
the feedback to create a revised plan.

4. Target Users

The proposed application is intended for users who want: - A simple
starting point for regular physical activity - Personalized general
wellness planning - Easy-to-understand workout schedules - AI-assisted
adjustments based on feedback

The application is intended for general wellness and is not a
replacement for professional medical advice.

5. Key Features Identified During Brainstorming

User profile input

Seven-day workout plan generation

AI-powered personalization

General nutrition/recovery guidance

Feedback-based plan revision

SQLite database storage

Admin/user management functionality

REST API endpoints

Swagger API documentation

Demo mode for running without an API key

6. Expected Benefits

Saves time when creating a basic weekly activity plan

Provides a structured seven-day schedule

Makes AI assistance available through a simple web interface

Allows users to provide feedback and revise a plan

Demonstrates practical use of Generative AI in a web application

Provides a complete project that can be tested and demonstrated

