Result

9. Initial Brainstorming Outcome

The brainstorming phase resulted in the idea of building FitBuddy, a
web-based Generative AI application that combines FastAPI, SQLite and
Gemini to provide personalized general wellness workout planning and
feedback-based plan updates.

10. Conclusion

FitBuddy was selected as a practical Generative AI project because it
combines AI/LLM integration, web development, database management and
REST APIs in one application. The next phase will identify the detailed
functional and non-functional requirements of the system.
